+    /**
+      \brief Read and consume one complete FLRC packet.
+
+      This is a one-shot finite-RX seam. The caller must keep the radio out of
+      receive mode until this method returns. The method checks IRQ and command
+      status, reads packet length and RSSI from one FLRC packet-status result,
+      reads exactly that many FIFO bytes, and attempts checked cleanup before
+      returning. A non-standby initial snapshot returns unsafe without destructive
+      cleanup so the owner can take a fresh bounded recovery attempt.
+
+      The active modem must be FLRC. The method checks GET_PACKET_TYPE and its
+      command status before using FLRC packet status; a wrong modem fails
+      closed without a FIFO read.
